  "description": "OKEYUZ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C73 H41 Er5 F54 N2 O30,C6 H14. From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er4 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er5 (Er) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.560-3.890 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.29-113.54°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C73H41Er5F54N2O30·C6H14.",
